Warm chestnut-brown coat with a soft bib and a pure white belly.
It wears a classic eighteenth-century ceremonial judge's wig of overlapping white curls (#ffffff and #dbe4ee)
with tailored anatomical slits through which the big shell-shaped ears rise majestically,
a tailored bow at the nape and cannon curls stepped along the cheeks,
